flowchart TD
  A[1. Group candidate stations] --> C{2. Candidate available in this cell?}
  C -- No --> U[Leave cell unrepresented]
  C -- Yes --> P[2a. Prepare sounding profiles]
  subgraph cell[2. Assess candidates within each cell]
    P --> W{2b. Find a qualifying year: coverage passes?}
    W -- No --> E{Earlier endpoint available?}
    E -- Yes: move back one day --> W
    E -- No: next candidate --> C
    W -- Yes --> R[Accept station]
  end
  R --> F[Finish cell]
  U --> F
  F -- More cells --> C
  F -- All cells assessed --> S[3. Summarize errors]
